From 2b8a476bbd555199576a3630ca62da37fe8f864f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:51:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Revert #65's Intel Arc patch (red picture on NVIDIA)

With an empty shader store, races on the old renderer turned red with
magenta cars on NVIDIA (2026-10-21 release smoke test). The previous
renderer and this tree without the patch's shader translator changes
both drew correctly. The patch also turned direct memory off and undid
the SanitizeCopyLayers image copies for every GPU, which it does not
describe. FIX-188 brings its Intel Arc changes back for Intel GPUs only.

This reverts commit a05f3d2c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
